{"seq":1,"slug":"lineage-fundamentals","title":"数据血缘基础概念","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/data-governance-lineage/lineage/lineage-fundamentals","wordCount":1714,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"数据血缘基础概念\">数据血缘基础概念</h1><p>一张 BI 报表的&quot;转化率&quot;指标突然下降 15%。是上游数据源出了问题，还是中间某个 ETL 逻辑被改了，还是报表自身的计算公式有 bug？没有血缘时，这个问题需要数据工程师手动翻查代码、日志、配置。有了血缘，一次点击就能看到这个指标从源表到最终展示的全部路径，精确定位断裂点。数据血缘（Data Lineage）就是数据资产的&quot;家谱图&quot;——记录每份数据从何而来、经过怎样的转换、流向了何处。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>数据血缘</strong>：记录数据从源头到终端每一步转换的有向无环图（DAG），节点是数据资产，边是转换操作</li>\n<li><strong>血缘粒度</strong>：表级（表→表）、列级（列→列）、值级（行→行）三层精度模型</li>\n<li><strong>静态血缘 vs 动态血缘</strong>：代码解析获得的设计意图 vs 执行时捕获的实际行为</li>\n<li><strong>OpenLineage</strong>：Linux Foundation 治下的开放血缘标准，定义 Job→Run→Dataset 的事件模型</li>\n<li><strong>影响分析</strong>：沿血缘图遍历确定变更影响范围的核心应用</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"血缘的形式化定义\">血缘的形式化定义</h2><p>血缘是一个<strong>有向无环图（DAG）</strong>，节点是数据资产（表、视图、列、文件、报表、特征），边是转换操作（ETL 作业、SQL 查询、ML 管道）。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>V</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>其中</mtext><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi>E</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∣</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"3.0em\">→</mo><mpadded width=\"+0.6em\" lspace=\"0.3em\"><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub></mpadded></mover><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G = (V, E) \\quad \\text{其中} \\quad V = \\{d_1, d_2, \\ldots, d_n\\} \\quad E = \\{(d_i, d_j, t_{ij}) \\mid d_i \\xrightarrow{t_{ij}} d_j\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">其中</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2026em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel x-arrow\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.0526em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.322em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight x-arrow-pad\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3281em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2819em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.689em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"height:0.522em;min-width:1.469em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.522em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 522\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 241v40h399891c-47.3 35.3-84 78-110 128\n-16.7 32-27.7 63.7-33 95 0 1.3-.2 2.7-.5 4-.3 1.3-.5 2.3-.5 3 0 7.3 6.7 11 20\n 11 8 0 13.2-.8 15.5-2.5 2.3-1.7 4.2-5.5 5.5-11.5 2-13.3 5.7-27 11-41 14.7-44.7\n 39-84.5 73-119.5s73.7-60.2 119-75.5c6-2 9-5.7 9-11s-3-9-9-11c-45.3-15.3-85\n-40.5-119-75.5s-58.3-74.8-73-119.5c-4.7-14-8.3-27.3-11-40-1.3-6.7-3.2-10.8-5.5\n-12.5-2.3-1.7-7.5-2.5-15.5-2.5-14 0-21 3.7-21 11 0 2 2 10.3 6 25 20.7 83.3 67\n 151.7 139 205zm0 0v40h399900v-40z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.011em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是数据资产节点，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{ij}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9012em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的转换操作。DAG 特性保证不存在循环依赖（如果存在，说明数据流有设计缺陷）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"血缘粒度层次\">血缘粒度层次</h2><p>血缘可以在不同粒度级别捕获，粒度越细越精确，但采集成本和存储开销也越高。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TB&#10;    subgraph Coarse[粗粒度]&#10;        TL[表级血缘&lt;br/&gt;Table → Table]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph Medium[中粒度]&#10;        CL[列级血缘&lt;br/&gt;Column → Column]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph Fine[细粒度]&#10;        VL[值级血缘&lt;br/&gt;Row/Cell → Row/Cell]&#10;    end&#10;    TL --&gt; CL --&gt; VL\">flowchart TB\n    subgraph Coarse[粗粒度]\n        TL[表级血缘&lt;br/&gt;Table → Table]\n    end\n    subgraph Medium[中粒度]\n        CL[列级血缘&lt;br/&gt;Column → Column]\n    end\n    subgraph Fine[细粒度]\n        VL[值级血缘&lt;br/&gt;Row/Cell → Row/Cell]\n    end\n    TL --&gt; CL --&gt; VL</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>粒度</th>\n<th>记录内容</th>\n<th>典型用途</th>\n<th>实现复杂度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>表级</td>\n<td>表 A 整体流向表 B</td>\n<td>影响分析：源表变更影响哪些下游表</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>列级</td>\n<td>表 A.col_x 转换为表 B.col_y</td>\n<td>精确影响分析、PII 传播追踪</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>值级</td>\n<td>某条记录的值来自哪条源记录</td>\n<td>审计追溯、GDPR 删除权</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>列级血缘</strong>是 2026 年的实践标准——它在精度和成本之间取得了最佳平衡。表级太粗（&quot;表 A 影响表 B&quot;无法定位具体字段），值级太贵（需要在运行时追踪每条记录的来源）。大多数治理场景——PII 传播分析、变更影响评估、质量根因追溯——列级血缘即可满足。</p>\n<h2 id=\"血缘的时间维度\">血缘的时间维度</h2><p>血缘不只有&quot;空间&quot;维度（数据从哪里来），还有&quot;时间&quot;维度（这条血缘关系是什么时候建立的）：</p>\n<p><strong>静态血缘（Design-time Lineage）</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>来源：SQL 代码解析、ETL 作业定义、dbt model 声明</li>\n<li>特点：反映&quot;设计意图&quot;——代码写的是什么</li>\n<li>局限：不反映运行时的条件分支、动态 SQL、动态表名</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>动态血缘（Runtime Lineage）</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>来源：执行计划拦截、运行时事件捕获</li>\n<li>特点：反映&quot;实际发生&quot;——执行引擎真正做了什么</li>\n<li>优势：能捕获动态 SQL（<code>EXECUTE IMMEDIATE</code>）、条件分支、参数化表名</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>历史血缘（Historical Lineage）</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>来源：带时间戳的血缘事件存储</li>\n<li>特点：回答&quot;过去某个时间点的血缘关系是什么样的&quot;</li>\n<li>用途：审计追溯（&quot;3 个月前，这张报表的数据来自哪里&quot;）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"血缘元素模型\">血缘元素模型</h2><p>一条完整的血缘记录包含以下元素：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>元素</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>源资产</td>\n<td>数据的起点</td>\n<td><code>warehouse.public.orders</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>目标资产</td>\n<td>数据的终点</td>\n<td><code>analytics.wide.order_summary</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>转换操作</td>\n<td>源到目标的处理逻辑</td>\n<td><code>spark_job_daily_aggregate</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>转换类型</td>\n<td>操作的语义分类</td>\n<td>AGGREGATE / FILTER / JOIN / DERIVE</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>时间戳</td>\n<td>血缘关系建立的时间</td>\n<td><code>2026-07-01T03:00:00Z</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>粒度</td>\n<td>表级/列级/值级</td>\n<td>Column: <code>orders.amount</code> → <code>order_summary.total_amount</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>OpenLineage 标准用三个核心实体建模：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Job</mtext><mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"3.0em\">→</mo><mpadded width=\"+0.6em\" lspace=\"0.3em\"><mtext>Run</mtext></mpadded></mover><mtext>(InputDataset, OutputDataset)</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Job} \\xrightarrow{\\text{Run}} \\text{(InputDataset, OutputDataset)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1113em;vertical-align:-0.011em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Job</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel x-arrow\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1003em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.322em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight x-arrow-pad\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">Run</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.689em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"height:0.522em;min-width:1.469em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.522em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 522\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 241v40h399891c-47.3 35.3-84 78-110 128\n-16.7 32-27.7 63.7-33 95 0 1.3-.2 2.7-.5 4-.3 1.3-.5 2.3-.5 3 0 7.3 6.7 11 20\n 11 8 0 13.2-.8 15.5-2.5 2.3-1.7 4.2-5.5 5.5-11.5 2-13.3 5.7-27 11-41 14.7-44.7\n 39-84.5 73-119.5s73.7-60.2 119-75.5c6-2 9-5.7 9-11s-3-9-9-11c-45.3-15.3-85\n-40.5-119-75.5s-58.3-74.8-73-119.5c-4.7-14-8.3-27.3-11-40-1.3-6.7-3.2-10.8-5.5\n-12.5-2.3-1.7-7.5-2.5-15.5-2.5-14 0-21 3.7-21 11 0 2 2 10.3 6 25 20.7 83.3 67\n 151.7 139 205zm0 0v40h399900v-40z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.011em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">(InputDataset, OutputDataset)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><ul>\n<li><strong>Job</strong>：一个可重复执行的转换定义（如 Airflow Task、dbt Model、Spark Application）</li>\n<li><strong>Run</strong>：Job 的一次具体执行实例，带开始/结束时间、状态和持续时长</li>\n<li><strong>Dataset</strong>：输入或输出的数据资产，带 schema facet 描述列级细节、带 lineage facet 描述列映射</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这三个实体构成了血缘事件的最小完备模型——任何数据转换都可以用&quot;某个 Job 在某次 Run 中读取了哪些 InputDataset、产出了哪些 OutputDataset&quot;来描述。</p>\n<h2 id=\"血缘的核心用途\">血缘的核心用途</h2><p><strong>1. 影响分析（Impact Analysis）</strong></p>\n<p>&quot;如果我改了源表的这个字段，下游会有什么影响？&quot;——这是血缘最高频的使用场景。通过下游遍历血缘图，可以在变更前精确识别所有受影响的资产。</p>\n<p><strong>2. 根因分析（Root Cause Analysis）</strong></p>\n<p>&quot;这张报表的数据为什么不对？&quot;——沿血缘图向上游追溯，定位数据质量劣化的根源。结合操作元数据（作业状态、运行时间），可以精确定位&quot;哪个作业在什么时间产出了坏数据&quot;。</p>\n<p><strong>3. 合规审计（Compliance Audit）</strong></p>\n<p>&quot;PII 数据流向了哪些系统？&quot;——通过血缘传播追踪，从 PII 源头列出发，遍历所有下游路径，确认每个节点都施加了合规的脱敏或访问控制。</p>\n<p><strong>4. 变更管理（Change Management）</strong></p>\n<p>&quot;哪些管道在消费这个即将下线的表？&quot;——在执行 schema 变更或资产退役前，通过血缘确认消费者列表，逐一通知或迁移。</p>\n<p><strong>5. 数据信任（Data Trust）</strong></p>\n<p>&quot;这个指标是怎么算出来的？&quot;——分析师可以沿血缘图查看指标从原始日志到最终 dashboard 的完整计算路径，建立对数据的信任。</p>\n<h2 id=\"血缘与治理的关系\">血缘与治理的关系</h2><p>血缘不是独立于治理的技术系统——它是治理的&quot;执行通道&quot;。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    GOV[治理策略] --&gt;|定义规则| TAG[分类标签]&#10;    TAG --&gt;|附着于| ASSET[源资产]&#10;    ASSET --&gt;|通过血缘传播| DOWN[下游资产]&#10;    DOWN --&gt;|自动继承| TAG2[继承标签]&#10;    TAG2 --&gt;|触发| ACT[治理动作&lt;br/&gt;脱敏/告警/阻断]\">flowchart LR\n    GOV[治理策略] --&gt;|定义规则| TAG[分类标签]\n    TAG --&gt;|附着于| ASSET[源资产]\n    ASSET --&gt;|通过血缘传播| DOWN[下游资产]\n    DOWN --&gt;|自动继承| TAG2[继承标签]\n    TAG2 --&gt;|触发| ACT[治理动作&lt;br/&gt;脱敏/告警/阻断]</pre><p>典型场景：治理策略规定&quot;Restricted 级别数据不得进入非生产环境&quot;。血缘系统自动检测到标为 Restricted 的列通过 ETL 流入了开发环境的表——触发违规告警并阻断后续执行。这就是&quot;通过血缘执行治理&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>数据血缘是治理的&quot;神经系统&quot;——它用 DAG 模型记录数据的完整流转路径，让影响分析、根因追溯、合规审计从人工考古变为自动推导。列级血缘是 2026 年的实践标准（精度与成本最佳平衡），OpenLineage 是跨工具互操作的事实标准。血缘的五大核心用途——影响分析、根因分析、合规审计、变更管理、数据信任——都依赖于高质量的血缘图。</p>\n<p>血缘是治理的神经系统，但它需要从底层的<a href=\"../foundations/metadata-management\">元数据管理</a>获取基础数据，也需要高效的<a href=\"lineage-collection\">采集机制</a>来保证图谱的完整性和实时性。采集到的血缘数据最终要通过<a href=\"lineage-visualization\">可视化与分析</a>转化为可操作的洞察。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"数据血缘基础概念","id":"数据血缘基础概念"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"血缘的形式化定义","id":"血缘的形式化定义"},{"level":2,"text":"血缘粒度层次","id":"血缘粒度层次"},{"level":2,"text":"血缘的时间维度","id":"血缘的时间维度"},{"level":2,"text":"血缘元素模型","id":"血缘元素模型"},{"level":2,"text":"血缘的核心用途","id":"血缘的核心用途"},{"level":2,"text":"血缘与治理的关系","id":"血缘与治理的关系"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"元数据管理体系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/data-governance-lineage/foundations/metadata-management"},"next":{"title":"血缘自动化采集","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/data-governance-lineage/lineage/lineage-collection"}}